WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
Write the lesson in one sentence. List

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.560
the shots you need. Charge two camera

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.260
batteries. Do not format the backup card.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.260
Record a short sound check. Leave room

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.840
for another take. Label every source folder.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:14.840
Back up the entire session.